#
# The repository root normalises everything to LF. PowerShell scripts are the
# one place that hurts: Windows PowerShell 5.1 mis-parses some constructs in an
# LF-only file (a here-string terminator is not recognised, and the remainder of
# the script is swallowed into a string literal). These files only ever run on
# Windows, so check them out with CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
